   "text": "Trade-offs to raise\n\u2022 Dedup key per (user, event)\n\u2022 Quiet hours, opt-outs, frequency caps\n\u2022 Immediate vs digest\n\u2022 Retries via delay queue + backoff\n\u2022 Provider fallback (SMS if push fails)\n\u2022 Template + locale rendering",
   "originalText": "Trade-offs to raise\n\u2022 Dedup key per (user, event)\n\u2022 Quiet hours, opt-outs, frequency caps\n\u2022 Immediate vs digest\n\u2022 Retries via delay queue + backoff\n\u2022 Provider fallback (SMS if push fails)\n\u2022 Template + locale rendering",
